translate italian izzyp3_8c15c125:

    # gl "Anyway, yeah, I'll take whatever I can get at this point."
    gl "Comunque, sì, a questo punto accetto qualsiasi cosa mi capiti."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzyconversations/izzyp3.rpy:22
translate italian izzyp3_a832b876:

